nginx-pgp-auth (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian package for the ngx_http_pgp_auth nginx module.
    Builds the module against this release's nginx using its own configure
    flags, installs it as a dynamic module, and enables it via
    /etc/nginx/modules-enabled.

